{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_18baefc518b947eb-384\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>陳展鵬與太太單文柔結婚多年依然愛得甜蜜，是圈中公認的模範夫妻。兩人不時在社交平台分享與愛女「小豬比」的溫馨日常，日前單文柔更在大批網民面前大爆囡囡因為太想戴眼鏡，竟然發揮創意自己DIY了一副，更笑指女兒瞬間變身成「林亞珍 2.0」！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_18baefc518b947eb-385\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>單文柔哭笑不得地在社交網分享道：「驗眼明明OK ！但有人因為太想戴眼鏡…竟然自己動手DIY剪咗兩塊『磨砂鏡片』塞入去？！真係笑到我肚痛，完全係林亞珍 2.0 造型！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_18baefc518b947eb-385\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7332094b-977f-4a35-b1dc-49a3876d403b.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZlhSNjCLRy1789525700.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7332094b-977f-4a35-b1dc-49a3876d403b.jpeg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"124c7e11-c98b-41a0-97c3-f6b85d9fe41a.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262uLf8dPD991789525699.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"124c7e11-c98b-41a0-97c3-f6b85d9fe41a.jpeg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_18baefc518b947eb-386\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從曝光的相片中可見，以一頭可愛孖辮造型示人的小豬比，戴上了粉色眼鏡框，雙手叉腰兼精靈地嘟嘴賣萌。最搞笑的是眼鏡框中間夾著她親手剪裁的「磨砂鏡片」，模樣十分逗趣，瞬間萌翻大批網民，紛紛留言大讚：「豬比巧可愛EE好想抱抱」、「so cute」！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8f4fe816-a92a-4b48-bec2-4144cac1dcf0.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GqjmAusxxl1789525699.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8f4fe816-a92a-4b48-bec2-4144cac1dcf0.jpeg.webp\"/></div></div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_18baefc518b947eb-387\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>除了搞笑的日常百態外，單文柔亦記錄了小豬比返學，以及認真練習小提琴的模樣。年紀細細的小豬比早已展現出多才多藝的一面，不僅曾在節目中表演過可愛的機械舞，平時還接觸了溜冰、騎馬等多項運動。足見陳展鵬與單文柔對愛女的多元發展可謂悉心栽培。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T02:59:47.771510+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}